---
import EditorialPage from '../components/EditorialPage.astro';

const page = {
  path: '/ecommerce-seo-services/',
  title: 'Ecommerce SEO Services for Online Stores | Bright Forge',
  description: 'Ecommerce SEO for Shopify and WooCommerce stores: category and product pages, technical fixes and content, with published results for five online shops.',
  h1: 'Ecommerce SEO Services for Online Stores',
  crumb: 'Ecommerce SEO',
  parents: [{ name: 'Industries', url: '/industries/' }],
  lead: [
    "Most of an online shop's search traffic should arrive on category and product pages. We make those pages findable: the right categories, clear product detail, a site Google can crawl without getting lost in filters, and content that helps a shopper decide.",
  ],
  sections: [
    {
      h2: 'Stores we have worked on',
      html: `<ul class="bf-results">
<li><span class="bf-num">7,410 to 17,600</span><span class="bf-what"><strong>Emily Bridalwear:</strong> organic clicks over three months, year on year (rounded)</span><a class="bf-src" href="/case-studies/bridal-dress-designer-seo/">Case study</a></li>
<li><span class="bf-num">15,200 to 22,700</span><span class="bf-what"><strong>Lost Dutchman Leather:</strong> organic clicks on the same comparison (rounded)</span><a class="bf-src" href="/case-studies/leather-wallet-ecommerce-seo/">Case study</a></li>
<li><span class="bf-num">6,550 to 10,900</span><span class="bf-what"><strong>Speediance Australia:</strong> organic clicks over six months, compared with the previous six</span><a class="bf-src" href="/case-studies/speediance-au-fitness-seo/">Case study</a></li>
<li><span class="bf-num">927 to 2,570</span><span class="bf-what"><strong>Speediance New Zealand:</strong> organic clicks over six months, compared with the previous six</span><a class="bf-src" href="/case-studies/speediance-nz-fitness-seo/">Case study</a></li>
<li><span class="bf-num">14,100 to 16,600</span><span class="bf-what"><strong>A boiler and heating spares retailer:</strong> organic clicks across successive six-month periods (rounded)</span><a class="bf-src" href="/case-studies/boiler-heating-spares-seo/">Case study</a></li>
</ul>
<p>Each case study states the period and the limits. The figures are search clicks, not orders.</p>`,
    },
    {
      h2: 'What we work on',
      html: `<dl class="bf-deliverables">
<dt>Categories</dt><dd>Which categories should exist, what they are called, and the copy and links each needs. See our article on <a href="/blog/ecommerce-category-pages-that-can-rank/">ecommerce category pages that can rank</a>.</dd>
<dt>Product pages</dt><dd>Titles, descriptions, dimensions, materials, variants, delivery and returns, product structured data.</dd>
<dt>Filters and duplicates</dt><dd>Stopping colour, size and sort options creating thousands of indexable URLs. This is <a href="/technical-seo-services-philippines/">technical SEO</a> work.</dd>
<dt>Stock changes</dt><dd>Out-of-stock and discontinued products.</dd>
<dt>Site speed</dt><dd>On the templates shoppers actually use.</dd>
<dt>Buying guides</dt><dd>That link to the categories they discuss, written through our <a href="/content-seo-services-philippines/">SEO content</a> process.</dd>
<dt>Tracking</dt><dd>Revenue from organic search, by landing page.</dd>
</dl>`,
    },
    {
      h2: 'How we do it',
      html: `<ol class="bf-steps">
<li>Crawl the store and review Search Console by page type.</li>
<li>Keyword research mapped to categories and products.</li>
<li>Fix technical faults in the theme or templates.</li>
<li>Improve the highest-value categories first, then products.</li>
<li>Report monthly on clicks, orders and revenue from search where tracking allows.</li>
</ol>`,
    },
    {
      h2: 'Platforms',
      html: `<p>Shopify, WooCommerce and WordPress. For stores that sell in more than one country, see <a href="/international-seo-services/">international SEO</a>.</p>`,
    },
  ],
  faqs: [
    { question: 'Will you rewrite all our product descriptions?', answer: 'Only where it pays. We start with templates and the best-selling lines.' },
    { question: 'Do the published results show sales?', answer: 'No. They are Search Console clicks. Where a client has shared sales figures, the case study says so; where they have not, we do not claim them.' },
  ],
};
---
<EditorialPage page={page} />
